{quote}Impersonation prevention project will require some amendments to our privacy policies as this is currently nor covered by most of the localised notices. We should be able to demonstrate that the drivers are aware of this process. As similar projects have been already deployed in other markets, on the privacy side we will draft appropriate wording. Would you be able to confirm live-date once the contract is signed?{quote}

We are aiming for this to go live in October.

