Our preference is to produce the PoA in English but some jurisdictions may require the local language and/or format - this process will engage the Global Field Team local lawyer to support the request so expect additional time support time;

* Whether a digital PoA with e-signature is sufficient or if you require a hard copy signed with wet ink to be mailed to you;
{color:#6554c0}Digital will suffice{color}
